  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Tool Manipulation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level you have learned to manifest your domain. All weapon attacks made by creatures other than you become a guaranteed miss as you can manipulate all tools within your domain, causing them to come to life and obey your commands. <br />\n  At initiative 20, you choose one of your imbued tools to gain the benefits of <em>Floating Tool</em> and have all <em>Floating Tools</em> move 60 ft and attack a creature within range or have all creatures suffer the effects of <em>Wind Scythe</em>. You can control a number of <em>Floating Tools</em> equal to your CE modifier (min of 2) within your domain.</p>",
